  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>6 parallel branches (all run simultaneously, pipeline waits for all to finish):
1. RowGenerator → Compute ETL_STARTED_AT → Set ETL_STARTED_AT
2. Read divvy_trips watermarks   → Set LSET_DIVVY_TRIPS,   CET_DIVVY_TRIPS
3. Read citibike_trips watermarks → Set LSET_CITIBIKE_TRIPS, CET_CITIBIKE_TRIPS
4. Read noaa_lcd watermarks      → Set LSET_NOAA_LCD,      CET_NOAA_LCD
5. Read gbfs_station watermarks  → Set LSET_GBFS_STATION,  CET_GBFS_STATION
6. Reset current load_run_id rows in control.etl_dq_rule_result_* before DQ validation appends fresh evidence

All variables are JVM-level → available to all downstream pipelines via getVariable().
Load pipelines use LSET_*/CET_* for incremental filtering (WHERE raw_loaded_at BETWEEN LSET AND CET).
05_audit_staging_load_counts uses CET_* as the new LSET when updating etl_extraction_control.</note>
